== Trivia ==
*Upon buying an item from '''Tomioka''', players will receive the {{ach|ach=true|Rough Deal}}.
*There is a {{Item|Fairy Soul}} located under the stairs that lead up to Tomioka.
*Tomioka requesting {{Item|Titanic Experience Bottle|amount=2}}s could reference that that is approximately what would be needed to apply all of their enchantments to items.
*Tomioka's dialogue could suggest a link between the [[Crimson Isle]] and the [[Catacombs]] as both {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer}} (who is implied to have invented over-the-air contact) and {{NPCSprite|Udel}} (Abiphone salesman) are from {{Zone|Scarleton}}.

